1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,302
ATP only.

2
00:00:01,302 --> 00:00:10,377
The electron returns to P700, so nothing reduces NADP plus, and water is never split, so no oxygen.

3
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:19,752
ATP and oxygen is the tempting answer, but oxygen comes only from photolysis at photosystem two, which is not running in the loop.

